ラ</th>\n                            <th width=\"30%\">示唆内容</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/enen__74.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>シルエット</p></td>\n                            <td>デフォルト</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/enen__75.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>円陣</p></td>\n                            <td>高設定示唆(弱)</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/enen__76.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>横向き</p></td>\n                            <td>高設定示唆(強)</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/enen__77.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>黒枠</p></td>\n                            <td style=\"color:#0071C1;\">設定4以上<br>濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/enen__78.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>赤枠</p></td>\n                            <td style=\"color:#FE0101;\">設定5以上<br>濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/enen__79.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>金枠</p></td>\n                            <td style=\"color:#FE67FF;\">設定6濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n\n                <h4>炎炎ボーナス終了画面振り分け</h4>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n   